# Reviewed secret-scan allowlist: one glob per line, "#" starts a comment.
# scripts/check-secrets.sh skips a matching path ONLY when `git check-ignore`
# confirms it is gitignored. A matching file that is tracked or not ignored fails
# the check, so this list can never hide committed secrets. Without a .git
# directory nothing is skipped. Add a reason comment above every entry.

# Reason: Impeccable engine binaries are downloaded by `npx impeccable install`,
# are gitignored, and their compiled bytes can match AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16} by chance.
.agents/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/*
.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/*
.cursor/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/*
